# cards: a card is one of a kind on the Item page (docs/plan-cards.md 2.2). Jian and Lucia (party slot 1), the
# Quetzalcoatl card in the bag. Items, Cards: A slots it on Jian (Jian slot 5 = 236); R to Lucia, whose list still
# shows it (shot mv_lucia): A moves it (Lucia 0x020B46FE = 236, Jian 0); A again takes it off (Lucia 0); R back to
# Jian, A slots it on him again. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
wait 100
pin u16 0x020B4650 1
poke u8 0x0213BA1B 1
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
watch u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5
watch u16 0x020B46FE lucia_slot5
press X 3
wait 80
press Down 8
wait 20
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press Right 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
shot mv_jian
press A 8
wait 60
shot mv_jian_on
press R 8
wait 60
shot mv_lucia
press A 8
wait 60
shot mv_lucia_on
press A 8
wait 60
shot mv_lucia_off
press L 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
shot mv_jian_again
peek u16 0x020B46A2 jian_slot5_end
peek u16 0x020B46FE lucia_slot5_end
